About Porto Santo:

Known as the Golden Island, Porto Santo offers a unique beach with 9 km of fine golden sand, calm waters and natural therapeutic properties, with average temperatures between 24ºC and 25ºC.

The island has all the essential infrastructures:

schools, pharmacies, health centre, supermarkets, banks, airport, seaport, restaurants, hotels, golf course and therapeutic spas.

Also recognised for its environmental commitment, Porto Santo is a pioneer in the concept of a smart and sustainable island, free of fossil fuels.

A unique opportunity to live with tranquillity, comfort and quality of life by the sea.

Come and see this excellent opportunity!

